  "solution": "BODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/7751840ca1840d12cadc428f84d30e2cdcd5e7f82d52a57de21f2404c58eed88.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) − and ÷\n\nGiven: 7 ÷ 255 + 5 × 3 − 20 = 140\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 7 - 255 + 5 × __**3 **____**÷**____** 20**__ = 140\n\n⇒ 7 - 255 + __**5**____** × 0.15**__ = 140\n\n⇒ __**7**__ - 255 + **__0.75__** = 140\n\n⇒ __**7.75 - 255**__ = 247.25\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n**Option 2) + and ÷**\n\n**Given: 7 ÷ 255 + 5 × 3 − 20 = 140**\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 7 + **__255 __****__÷__****__ 5__** × 3 − 20 = 140\n\n⇒ 7 + **__51 × 3__** − 20 = 140\n\n⇒ __**7 + 15**____3__ − 20 = 140\n\n⇒ __**160**____** − 20**__** = 140**\n\n**⇒ LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 3) × and +\n\nGiven: 7 ÷ 255 + 5 × 3 − 20 = 140\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ __**7 ÷ 255 × 5**__ + 3 − 20 = 140\n\n⇒ __0.137** + 3**__ − 20 = 140\n\n⇒ __**3.137 − 20**__ = 140\n\n⇒ -16.8 = 140\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) + and −\n\nGiven: 7 ÷ 255 + 5 × 3 − 20 = 140\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ **__7 ÷ 255__** - 5 × 3 + 20 = 140\n\n⇒ 0.027 - __**5 × 3**__ + 20 = 140\n\n⇒ __**0.027**__ - 15 __**+ 20**__ = 140\n\n⇒ __**20.027 - 15**__ = 5.027 = 140\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 2\".",
